@startuml
!theme plain

title State Machine: Booking (預約訂單)

note as GlobalNote
  Terminal States: EXPIRED / NO_SHOW / COMPLETED / REFUNDED
  可退款: CANCELLED → REFUNDED
  不可退款: EXPIRED / NO_SHOW / CANCELLED(免退款條款)
end note

[*] --> PENDING : 建立預約單\n鎖定時段 TTL=15min (SD-01)

PENDING : 等待付款中\n時段狀態 = LOCKED
CONFIRMED : 訂單成立\n時段狀態 = BOOKED
EXPIRED : 無金流影響\n時段自動釋放
ACTIVE : 寵物已入店\n服務進行中
NO_SHOW : 訂金不退\n記錄 feeCharged
CANCELLED : 預約已取消\n等待退款判斷
REFUNDED : 含 PARTIAL / FULL 兩種子情境\n詳見 Refund 狀態機

PENDING --> CONFIRMED : 付款授權成功 (SD-02)\n或現場收銀 (SD-04)
PENDING --> EXPIRED : [CacheManager] TTL 到期\n自動釋放時段 → AVAILABLE

CONFIRMED --> MODIFIED : 客戶申請更改日期/服務
MODIFIED --> CONFIRMED : 新時段鎖定成功 (SD-08 衝突檢查通過)
MODIFIED --> CANCELLED : 無可用新時段

CONFIRMED --> ACTIVE : 實體櫃台報到成功 (SD-03)
CONFIRMED --> NO_SHOW : [系統排程] 預約時間+30min 仍未報到\n自動標記，訂金不退
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : 客戶或經理發起取消 (SD-07)

ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : [Manager 授權] 特殊情況強制取消\n退款比例由 CancellationService 計算
ACTIVE --> COMPLETED : 服務完畢，客戶接回

CANCELLED --> REFUNDED : 退款流程完成\n(Refund 實體非同步更新)

CANCELLED --> [*] : 無需退款之取消\n(免退款條款或 NO_SHOW)
EXPIRED --> [*]
NO_SHOW --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]

@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain

title State Machine: Refund (退款交易)

note as GlobalNote
  Terminal States: COMPLETED / CANCELLED / REJECTED
  核心防禦機制:
  1. idempotencyKey 防止重複退款
  2. TimeoutScheduler 防止 Webhook 永久卡死
  3. RetryScheduler + Exponential Backoff 防偶發中斷
  4. MANUAL_REVIEW 保證業務流程不死結
end note

[*] --> PENDING : [CancellationService] Booking → CANCELLED\n自動建立退款單\nrefundAmount 由 CancellationService 計算

PENDING : 等待非同步排程接手\nrefundAmount 已計算並鎖定\n(與 Booking 狀態解耦)

PROCESSING : 處理中，等待金流端回應\n[防護] 帶唯一 idempotencyKey 防重複扣款

FAILED : 自動退款失敗\n檢查 retry_count

MANUAL_REVIEW : 需人工介入審核\n(聯絡客戶索取匯款帳戶 / 線下協商)

state CANCELLED {
  note "退款申請撤回\nBooking 維持 CANCELLED 狀態" as N_CAN
}

state REJECTED {
  note "退款終止\n保留爭議紀錄供稽核" as N_REJ
}

state COMPLETED {
  note "資金已退還 (自動或人工)\n含 FULL / PARTIAL 兩種子情境\n實際金額見 refundAmount 欄位" as N_COMP
}

PENDING --> PROCESSING : [PaymentWorker] 排程掃描\n向金流網關發起退款 API (SD-07)
PENDING --> CANCELLED : [Manager] 申請無效\n或客戶主動撤回

PROCESSING --> COMPLETED : [Webhook] 金流端「退款成功」通知\n發送 Event → Booking 轉 REFUNDED\n觸發 NotificationService 通知客戶
PROCESSING --> FAILED : [Webhook] 金流拒絕\n(餘額不足/卡片失效)
PROCESSING --> FAILED : [TimeoutScheduler] 超過 24h 未收到 Webhook\n自動轉入重試流程

FAILED --> PROCESSING : [RetryScheduler] retry_count < 3\n指數退避重試 (Exponential Backoff)
FAILED --> MANUAL_REVIEW : [System] retry_count >= 3\n通知經理(Slack) + 通知客戶「處理中請稍候」

MANUAL_REVIEW --> REJECTED : [Manager] 審核不予退款\n(違反合約 / 客戶爭議)
MANUAL_REVIEW --> COMPLETED : [Manager] 完成線下匯款\n手動標記 + NotificationService 通知客戶

CANCELLED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<Terminal>>  #EAEAEA
  BackgroundColor<<Exception>> #FDF2F2
  BorderColor<<Exception>>     #E02424
  BackgroundColor<<Security>>  #FEF08A
  BorderColor<<Security>>      #A16207
}

title State Machine: Identity/User（客戶帳號與身分）

[*] --> UNVERIFIED : [Customer] 註冊帳號\nEntry: 建立 User 實體 (isVerified=false)\nAction: 發送 OTP

[*] --> ACTIVE : [Customer] 第三方 OAuth 登入 (LINE/Google)\nEntry: isVerified=true，綁定 ThirdPartyToken\nNote: 跳過 UNVERIFIED 流程

UNVERIFIED : 帳號已建立，等待驗證\n允許登入但功能受限\n無法建立 Booking\nOTP 有效期: 15min

UNVERIFIED --> ACTIVE      : [Customer] 成功輸入 OTP\nAction: isVerified=true\nAction: 簽發 JWT Token
UNVERIFIED --> OTP_EXPIRED : [Scheduler] 15min 未完成驗證\nAction: OTP 失效
UNVERIFIED --> DEACTIVATED <<Terminal>> : [Scheduler] 註冊後超過 30 天未驗證\nAction: 去識別化 & 釋放 Email/Phone

OTP_EXPIRED : OTP 已失效\n等待重新發送

OTP_EXPIRED --> UNVERIFIED    : [Customer] 重新發送驗證碼\nGuard: 24h 內重送次數 < 5\nAction: 產生新 OTP，舊 OTP 作廢
OTP_EXPIRED --> BLOCKED_TEMP  : [System] 24h 內重送 >= 5 次\nAction: 暫時封鎖，防 OTP 轟炸

BLOCKED_TEMP --> UNVERIFIED : [Scheduler] 24h 後自動解除封鎖

ACTIVE : 正常會員狀態\n允許建立 Booking 與上傳 VaccineRecord

ACTIVE --> PASSWORD_RESET : [Customer] 忘記密碼\nAction: 發送重設連結（有效期 30min）\nAction: 現有 JWT Token 失效

PASSWORD_RESET --> ACTIVE : [Customer] 完成重設\nAction: 簽發新 JWT Token
PASSWORD_RESET --> ACTIVE : [Scheduler] 30min 逾期\nAction: 連結失效，舊密碼恢復效力

ACTIVE --> BLACKLISTED <<Security>> : [System] NO_SHOW >= 3\n或 [Manager] 標記惡意客訴/棄養\nAction: 撤銷 JWT Token，API 403\nAction: 檢查現有 CONFIRMED Booking\n→ Manager 人工決定保留或取消

state BLACKLISTED <<Security>> {
  note "黑名單（奧客防禦）\n前端登入後僅可查歷史紀錄\n禁止線上建立新 Booking\n保留實體 Walk-in 權利（Manager 現場裁決）" as N_BLK
}

BLACKLISTED --> ACTIVE : [Manager] 顧客親自到店說明/補繳欠款\nAction: 重置 NO_SHOW 計數器
BLACKLISTED --> DEACTIVATED <<Terminal>> : [Customer] 發起帳號刪除申請

ACTIVE --> DEACTIVATED <<Terminal>> : [Customer] 帳號刪除申請（個資法）\n或 [Manager] 手動註銷

ACTIVE --> MERGED <<Terminal>> : [Admin] 偵測重複帳號，執行合併\nAction: 保留主帳號，資料遷移\nAction: 副帳號標記 MERGED（軟刪除）

state PASSWORD_RESET {
  note "重設連結有效期 30min\n現有 Token 已失效\n逾期自動恢復舊密碼效力" as N_PWD
}

state DEACTIVATED <<Terminal>> {
  note "軟刪除 (Soft Delete)\n去識別化時機:\n  立即: 遮蔽 Email/Phone\n  30天後: Hash 剩餘 PII\n保留 FK 關聯 (Booking/Incident)\n供財報與法務稽核" as N_DEACT
}

state MERGED <<Terminal>> {
  note "帳號已合併至主帳號\n資料已遷移，軟刪除保留\n不影響歷史 FK 完整性" as N_MERGED
}

DEACTIVATED --> [*]
MERGED      --> [*]

note as Guardrails
  技術指令:
  1. 個資法合規 (GDPR/PDPA):
     DEACTIVATED 禁止 DB DELETE
     立即遮蔽 Email/Phone
     30天後 Hash 剩餘 PII
  2. 黑名單自動防禦:
     監聽 Booking NO_SHOW 事件
     計數器達標自動轉 BLACKLISTED
     保護 Timeslot 與 Groomer 資源
  3. OTP 防轟炸:
     24h 內重送上限 5 次
     超限暫封 24h
  4. 驗證空窗期清理:
     30 天未驗證 → DEACTIVATED
     釋放 Email/Phone Unique Constraint
  5. BLACKLISTED 現有 Booking 處理:
     Manager 人工決定保留或取消
     不自動強制取消，避免客訴
end note

@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<Terminal>>  #EAEAEA
  BackgroundColor<<Exception>> #FDF2F2
  BorderColor<<Exception>>     #E02424
  BackgroundColor<<SLA>>       #FFFBEB
  BorderColor<<SLA>>           #D97706
}

title State Machine: Incident (異常通報與危機處理)

[*] --> REPORTED : [Groomer/Caregiver] 標記異常 (SD-06)\nEntry: 記錄 severityLevel & 綁定 TaskId/PetId\nAction: NotificationService 緊急推播至 Manager

REPORTED : 異常已立案，等待介入\nSLA 紅線: 15min

REPORTED --> UNACKNOWLEDGED_ALERT <<SLA>> : [Scheduler] 超過 15min 未處理\nAction: 升級警報（全店廣播）
REPORTED --> INVESTIGATING : [Manager] 接手處理\nGuard: severityLevel == LOW/MEDIUM\nAction: 記錄 ackTime & 綁定 handlerId
REPORTED --> ESCALATED : [Manager] 直接判定重大\nGuard: severityLevel == CRITICAL\nAction: 強制中止 ServiceTask → ABORTED

UNACKNOWLEDGED_ALERT --> INVESTIGATING : [Manager] 緊急接手
UNACKNOWLEDGED_ALERT --> CRITICAL_ESCALATION : [Scheduler] 再等 10min 仍無人接手\nAction: 自動致電店長/緊急聯絡人

CRITICAL_ESCALATION --> INVESTIGATING : [店長] 接手處理

INVESTIGATING : 負責人現場了解狀況\n(拍照存證/評估是否需送醫)

INVESTIGATING --> DISMISSED <<Terminal>> : [Manager] 判定誤報\nAction: Task 解除異常鎖定，恢復原流程
INVESTIGATING --> RESOLVED <<Terminal>> : [Manager] 輕微異常現場排除\nGuard: resolutionNote 已填寫\nAction: Task → GROOMING_ACTIVE\nAction: 通知 Groomer 可繼續作業
INVESTIGATING --> ESCALATED <<Exception>> : [Manager] 判定嚴重事故\nAction: 強制中止 ServiceTask → ABORTED\nAction: NotificationService 緊急聯絡飼主

state ESCALATED <<Exception>> {
  [*] --> MEDICAL_ATTENTION
  
  MEDICAL_ATTENTION : 等待獸醫診斷
  MEDICAL_ATTENTION --> MEDICAL_ATTENTION : [Scheduler] 30min 未取得診斷\n提醒 Manager 追蹤
  MEDICAL_ATTENTION --> OWNER_NEGOTIATION : [Manager] 取得診斷證明\nAction: 上傳 S3
  
  OWNER_NEGOTIATION : 與飼主協商補償方案
  OWNER_NEGOTIATION --> SETTLEMENT_REACHED : [Manager] 飼主同意和解
  OWNER_NEGOTIATION --> LEGAL_DISPUTE : [Manager] 飼主拒絕\nAction: 通知律師/保險公司
  
  LEGAL_DISPUTE --> SETTLEMENT_REACHED : [法務] 法律途徑達成和解
  
  SETTLEMENT_REACHED --> CLOSED <<Terminal>> : Guard: S3 文件齊全\n(診斷書 + 和解簽名單)\nAction: 寫入 Immutable Audit Log\nAction: Pet.medicalHistory 更新
}

state DISMISSED <<Terminal>> {
  note "誤報撤銷\n不影響系統與營運" as N_DIS
}

state RESOLVED <<Terminal>> {
  note "輕微異常已排除\n任務繼續執行\nGroomer 已通知" as N_RES
}

state CLOSED <<Terminal>> {
  note "重大事故歸檔\n保留完整醫療與和解紀錄\n供未來法務稽核\nPet.medicalHistory 已更新" as N_CLO
}

DISMISSED --> [*]
RESOLVED --> [*]
CLOSED --> [*]

note as Guardrails
  架構師技術指令 (v1.1):
  1. 生命週期解耦: Incident 壽命大於 Task
     Task ABORTED 後 Incident 仍須走到 CLOSED
  2. 責任歸屬: INVESTIGATING 強制綁定 handlerId
  3. 證據保全: CLOSED 前 Guard 強制 S3 文件齊全
  4. SLA 雙重監控:
     - 第一紅線: REPORTED 後 15min → UNACKNOWLEDGED_ALERT
     - 第二紅線: 再 10min → CRITICAL_ESCALATION 自動致電
  5. severityLevel 路徑分流:
     LOW/MEDIUM → INVESTIGATING
     CRITICAL   → 直接 ESCALATED
end note

@enduml

@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<Terminal>>  #EAEAEA
  BackgroundColor<<Exception>> #FDF2F2
  BorderColor<<Exception>>     #E02424
}

title State Machine: Notification（通知發送機制）

[*] --> PENDING : [System/Service] 觸發通知 Event\nEntry: 建立 Notification 實體\n  retryCount = 0\nAction: 渲染樣板 (Template Rendering)

PENDING : 佇列中等待發送\n渠道: Line / Push / SMS / Email\n[V1: 主渠道失敗即 DEAD_LETTER]\n[V2: 自動 Fallback 次要渠道]

PENDING --> SENDING : [NotificationWorker] 從 Message Queue 取出\nAction: 呼叫第三方 API (Twilio/SendGrid/Line)
PENDING --> EXPIRED <<Terminal>> : [Scheduler] 通知已超過有效期限\n(時效性通知超過預約/事件時間)\nAction: 直接作廢，不再發送

SENDING : 傳輸至第三方供應商中\n等待同步或非同步 Webhook 回應

SENDING --> DELIVERED : [API/Webhook] 供應商回傳接收成功\nAction: 記錄 providerMessageId
SENDING --> FAILED <<Exception>> : [API/Webhook] 供應商回傳失敗\n(號碼錯誤 / 憑證失效 / 連線逾時)
SENDING --> FAILED <<Exception>> : [TimeoutScheduler] 超過 5min 未收到回應\nAction: 視為 Soft Bounce

FAILED : 發送失敗\n檢查 retryCount 與錯誤類型

FAILED --> PENDING : [RetryScheduler] Soft Bounce 重試\nGuard: retryCount < 3\n  AND errorType IN (TIMEOUT, HTTP_5XX)\nAction: retryCount + 1\nAction: 指數退避 (Exponential Backoff)

FAILED --> DEAD_LETTER <<Terminal>> : [System] Hard Bounce\n(HTTP 400 / 無效號碼 / 使用者封鎖)\n或 retryCount >= 3（重試耗盡）\nAction: 記錄 failureReason

state DELIVERED {
  note "已送達客戶設備或信箱\nV1: 生命週期終點\nV2: 可繼續追蹤 READ 狀態" as N_DEL
}

DELIVERED --> READ <<Terminal>> : [V2] [ClientApp/Pixel] 使用者已讀/點擊\nAction: 記錄 readAt 時間戳記
DELIVERED --> [*] : [V1 MVP 終點]

state READ <<Terminal>> {
  note "已讀確認 (V2 功能)\n供行銷漏斗或客訴爭議佐證" as N_READ
}

state EXPIRED <<Terminal>> {
  note "時效性通知已過期\n直接作廢，不佔用 API 配額" as N_EXP
}

state DEAD_LETTER <<Terminal>> {
  note "發送永久失敗 (Dead Letter Queue)\n重要通知升級人工處理:\n- 退款結果通知\n- 預約取消通知\n- 疫苗過期警告\n一般行銷通知直接作廢" as N_DLQ
}

READ        --> [*]
EXPIRED     --> [*]
DEAD_LETTER --> [*]

note as Guardrails
  技術指令:
  1. 非同步解耦 (Critical):
     業務服務只產生 Event
     NotificationWorker 接手 PENDING
     主業務流程絕不等待第三方 API
  2. 冪等性防護:
     重試呼叫帶唯一 idempotencyKey
     防止網路波動導致重複發送
  3. 錯誤分流 (Hard vs Soft Bounce):
     Soft (HTTP 5XX / Timeout) → RetryScheduler
     Hard (HTTP 400 / 封鎖)    →直接 DEAD_LETTER
  4. retryCount 初始值 = 0
     最多重試 3 次（retryCount 0→1→2→3）
     第 3 次失敗後 retryCount=3 → DEAD_LETTER
  5. SENDING 超時保護:
     5min 未收到 Webhook → 強制轉 FAILED
  6. MVP範疇:
     V1: DELIVERED 為終點，時效過期人工處理
     V2: READ 追蹤 / Fallback 渠道 / EXPIRED 自動作廢
end note

@enduml

