title State Machine: Schedule (員工排班)

note as Guardrails
  技術約束與架構指令 (SD-08 對齊):
  1. 母子級聯: Schedule 變動對 Timeslot 擁有絕對覆蓋權
  2. 瞬態保護: MODIFYING 強制所有修改必須經過 CONFLICT_CHECK
  3. 破壞性稽核: CANCELLED_WITH_IMPACT 寫入 Immutable Audit Log
     記錄授權 Manager ID + overrideReason
  4. 未確認保護: PUBLISHED 到期標記 autoConfirmed=true
     供人資部門事後審核
end note

[*] --> DRAFT : [Manager] 建立員工班表\nEntry: 初始化班表資料

DRAFT : 編輯中（不對外開放）\n班表週期通常以週為單位\n尚未生成 Timeslot

DRAFT --> PUBLISHED  : [Manager] 發布班表\nAction: 批次生成對應 Timeslot (AVAILABLE)
DRAFT --> DISCARDED <<Terminal>> : [Manager] 放棄草稿\nAction: 刪除草稿，不生成任何 Timeslot

PUBLISHED : 正式班表已生效\n系統已開放客戶預約

PUBLISHED --> CONFIRMED  : [Staff] 確認班表\nAction: 記錄確認時間與 IP
PUBLISHED --> MODIFYING <<Transient>> : [Manager/Staff] 發起修改或請假 (SD-08)
PUBLISHED --> COMPLETED <<Terminal>> : [Scheduler] 班表時間已過期\n員工未確認標記 autoConfirmed=true

CONFIRMED : 員工已確認排班\n出勤紀錄具完整法律效力

CONFIRMED --> MODIFYING <<Transient>> : [Manager/Staff] 發起修改或請假 (SD-08)
CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED <<Terminal>> : [Scheduler] 班表時間已過期

state MODIFYING <<Transient>> {
  [*] --> CONFLICT_CHECK

  CONFLICT_CHECK : 系統檢查關聯 Timeslot 狀態

  CONFLICT_CHECK --> NO_CONFLICT       : [System] 對應時段皆為 AVAILABLE/LOCKED\n尚無已付款 Booking
  CONFLICT_CHECK --> CONFLICT_DETECTED : [System] 發現 BOOKED 時段\n已有確定預約的客戶

  NO_CONFLICT : 無衝突，可直接套用

  CONFLICT_DETECTED : 需人工介入決策\n觸發 SD-08 排班衝突預警
  CONFLICT_DETECTED --> NO_CONFLICT : [Manager] 放棄修改\n維持原班表
}

MODIFYING --> PUBLISHED              : [System] 無衝突，自動套用變更\nAction: 同步更新/刪除關聯 Timeslot\nNote: 修改後重置為 PUBLISHED\n員工需重新確認新班表
MODIFYING --> CANCELLED_WITH_IMPACT <<Exception>> : [Manager] 強制執行 Force Override\n⚠️ 高危操作，需輸入 overrideReason

state CANCELLED_WITH_IMPACT <<Exception>> {
  note "強制改班導致既有預約取消\n強制記錄 overrideReason 供稽核" as N_CAN
}

CANCELLED_WITH_IMPACT --> PUBLISHED : Action: 關聯 Timeslot → BLOCKED\nAction: CancellationService 觸發 Booking 取消 & Refund\nAction: NotificationService 通知客戶與員工\nAction: 寫入 Immutable Audit Log (Manager ID + Reason)

state DISCARDED <<Terminal>> {
  note "草稿已放棄\n不影響任何 Timeslot" as N_DIS
}

state COMPLETED <<Terminal>> {
  note "歷史班表\n作為計算員工出勤與薪資之基準\nautoConfirmed=true 者需人資審核" as N_COMP
}

DISCARDED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

@enduml

