title State Machine: VaccineRecord（疫苗記錄與醫療合規）

note as Guardrails
  跨邊界防護機制:
  1. Immutable 原則:
     紀錄不允許 UPDATE
     只能走完生命週期被 REJECTED 或 SUPERSEDED
  2. 審核時即分流（消除假合規窗口）:
     expiryDate > now+30天 → VALID
     now < expiryDate <= now+30天 → 直接 EXPIRING_SOON
     expiryDate <= now → REJECTED（已過期文件）
  3. VaccineExpiredEvent 跨服務連動:
     BookingService 監聽事件
     CONFIRMED Booking: 倒數 3 天後強制取消
     ACTIVE Booking: 僅警告，動物已在店不強制取消
  4. Pet.vaccineValid 單一真相來源:
     VALID/EXPIRING_SOON = true
     EXPIRED = false
     由 VaccineRecord 狀態機統一維護
end note

[*] --> PENDING_VERIFICATION : [Customer/FrontDesk] 上傳疫苗證明\nEntry: 記錄上傳時間與 S3 文件路徑

PENDING_VERIFICATION : 待人工審核（尚未具備合規效力）\n必要疫苗: DOG(狂犬病+犬五合一) / CAT(貓三合一)

PENDING_VERIFICATION --> VALID : [Manager] 審核通過\nGuard: expiryDate > now + 30天\nAction: 寫入 expiryDate\nAction: Pet.vaccineValid = true

PENDING_VERIFICATION --> EXPIRING_SOON <<Warning>> : [Manager] 審核通過\nGuard: now < expiryDate <= now + 30天\nAction: Pet.vaccineValid = true\nAction: 立即發送「即將過期」警告

PENDING_VERIFICATION --> REJECTED <<Exception>> : [Manager] 審核退回\nGuard: 文件模糊 / 非必要疫苗 / expiryDate <= now\nAction: 通知客戶原因，建立新 VaccineRecord 重新上傳

VALID : 醫療合規期內\nPet.vaccineValid = true\n允許 Booking 建立與實體 Check-in

VALID --> EXPIRING_SOON <<Warning>> : [Scheduler] 每日批次掃描\nGuard: 距 expiryDate <= 30 天\nAction: 發送「準備更新」提醒

VALID --> SUPERSEDED <<Terminal>> : [System] 該寵物新 VaccineRecord 審核通過\nAction: 舊紀錄提早退役

state EXPIRING_SOON <<Warning>> {
  note "即將過期，仍具合規效力\n前端亮黃燈警示" as N_WARN
}

EXPIRING_SOON --> EXPIRING_SOON : [Scheduler] 每 7 天重複提醒\n（最多 4 次，防通知轟炸）

EXPIRING_SOON --> EXPIRED <<Terminal>> : [Scheduler] 每日批次掃描\nGuard: expiryDate < now\nAction: Pet.vaccineValid = false\nAction: 拋出 VaccineExpiredEvent

EXPIRING_SOON --> SUPERSEDED <<Terminal>> : [System] 該寵物新 VaccineRecord 審核通過

state REJECTED <<Exception>> {
  note "無效文件，不影響原有合規狀態\n本紀錄永久保留為稽核軌跡\n客戶需重新建立全新 VaccineRecord" as N_REJ
}

state EXPIRED <<Terminal>> {
  note "已過期失去效力\nPet.vaccineValid = false\nVaccineExpiredEvent 觸發鏈:\n  T+0: 通知客戶更新\n  T+7天前: 每日提醒\n  T-3天: 最後警告\n  T-3天仍未更新:\n    CONFIRMED Booking → 強制 CANCELLED + 退款\n    ACTIVE Booking（已在店）→ 僅警告，不強制取消" as N_EXP
}

state SUPERSEDED <<Terminal>> {
  note "被新紀錄取代\n歷史醫療軌跡永久封存 (Read-only)\n不影響 Pet.vaccineValid（由新紀錄維護）" as N_SUP
}

REJECTED   --> [*]
EXPIRED    --> [*]
SUPERSEDED --> [*]

@enduml
